# Voice Profile (example / starter template)

> Copy this file to ``voice-profile.md`` in the same directory and fill it
> in with your own voice. The copied file is gitignored so personal
> content never leaks into the repository.
>
> Until you copy it, the writer agent falls back to the shared voice profile
> at ``packages/agents/_shared/prompts/voice-profile.md`` — which is itself
> gitignored, so on a fresh clone you need to create that one first from
> ``voice-profile.md.example`` in the same directory.

## Tone

_e.g. "Conversational but technically precise. Avoids marketing speak."_

## Vocabulary preferences

_e.g. "Prefers 'use' over 'utilize', 'build' over 'leverage'."_

## Structural habits

_e.g. "Short paragraphs. Lists for enumeration. Avoids hedging phrases."_

## Avoid

_e.g. "Em dashes, exclamation marks, 'delve', 'utilize'."_
